# Pull request titles

Use the same [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/)
shape as git subjects for the PR title:

```text
<type>(optional-scope): <imperative summary>
```

- Prefer matching the primary commit (or intended squash subject).
- Subject / PR title ~72 characters or less; no trailing period; no emoji.
- Do not leave GitHub’s default `Update …` / branch-name titles.
- When the `git` plugin is also installed, keep titles aligned with
  `git-commit-messages` types and rules.
